Let word be "   fly me   to   the moon  ".
Let final be the last position of word.
Let position be final.
Let letters be 0.
Repeat while position is at least 0 and character position of word is 32.
Set position to one less than position.

Repeat while position is at least 0 and character position of word isn't equal to 32.
Add 1 to letters.
Set position to one less than position.

Print letters.
